SUMMARY:Subscription audit (10 minutes)
DESCRIPTION:Monthly check:\n• iPhone: Settings › [your name] › Subscr
 iptions. Cancel anything you didn't use last month.\n• Scan your card st
 atement for small recurring charges.\n• Note any free trials and their c
 ancel-by dates.\n\nA $9.99 charge you've forgotten is about $120 a year.\n
